cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use X-Amplicon in your research, please cite this software."
title: "X-Amplicon: a local no-code workflow for 16S rRNA amplicon analysis"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Xu
    given-names: XinXi
    alias: "徐新玺"
repository-code: "https://github.com/xuxinxi14/X--Amplicon"
url: "https://github.com/xuxinxi14/X--Amplicon/releases/tag/v0.1.2"
license: GPL-3.0-only
version: "0.1.2"
date-released: "2026-05-15"
abstract: "X-Amplicon is a local Python-first workflow with a browser Web UI for paired-end 16S rRNA amplicon analysis, generating OTU/ASV tables, taxonomy annotation, diversity analyses, interactive visualizations, reports, and provenance records."
keywords:
  - 16S rRNA
  - amplicon sequencing
  - microbiome
  - bioinformatics workflow
  - no-code
  - Web UI
  - reproducibility
  - provenance
